# Build output. Never committed; never in a crash report either.
/target/
/target-*/
/apps/craftkit-web/dist/
/apps/craftkit-web/pkg/

# Generated by `wasm-bindgen`, not source.
/apps/craftkit-web/*.wasm

# Crash reports contain the user's plan. They are theirs, and they are local.
/crash-reports/

# The fuzzer's working inputs and its findings: files of bytes nobody wrote.
# Local, and never in the repository. §180.
/fuzz-out/

# The output of a failing repetition of the flake hunt: the only copy of what
# a failing run said. Local, and never in the repository. §229.
/flake-out/

# Editors and operating systems.
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/

# Nothing here is generated-on-demand except target/, so this list is
# deliberately short. If you find yourself adding an exception, check whether
# the file belongs in the repository at all — `cargo xtask assets` will want it
# in ATTRIBUTION.md.
